      "en": "Solomon awoke; and behold, it was a dream. Then he came to Jerusalem and stood before the ark of the LORD’s covenant, and offered up burnt offerings, offered peace offerings, and made a feast for all his servants.",
      "ko": "솔로몬이 깨어보니 꿈이더라 이에 예루살렘에 이르러 여호와의 언약궤 앞에 서서 번제와 수은제를 드리고 모든 신복을 위하여 잔치하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "0888283879a988d0f72d342df37b4e97e7da04c8bed0ffde7f2139ad2030c72b",
      "translation_text_hash": "78c17a52febc8ad80b3265cfc3daeef8f4ee29818438e9cbcab71c20a4eef0a3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
