      "en": "Then two women who were prostitutes came to the king, and stood before him.",
      "ko": "때에 창기 두 계집이 왕에게 와서 그 앞에 서며",
      "source_text_hash": "d7c0e1139157d926a7d712b0874a624fbe7778a95cdb80f5d964d5b8cbf743ee",
