      "en": "The third day after I delivered, this woman delivered also. We were together. There was no stranger with us in the house, just us two in the house.",
      "ko": "나의 해산한지 삼일에 이 계집도 해산하고 우리가 함께 있었고 우리 둘 외에는 집에 다른 사람이 없었나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "8c8d10befaa98d8461390fbafd1517937659965533e95cfa0af4602655f1055f",
      "translation_text_hash": "1459abfef069039ee704140864c46ea139530a17647e16e9a8ad6acf7a071845",
