      ],
      "en": "The king said, “Get me a sword.” So they brought a sword before the king.",
      "ko": "또 가로되 칼을 내게로 가져오라 하니 칼을 왕의 앞으로 가져온지라",
      "source_text_hash": "2dc7a40e19f53bb43b3b737f089d069388f107b341446458b70ede013720a40a",
      "translation_text_hash": "529c706421a2963ed9df51adb99e3c4ccf82da27843a32d3d4013193431ed559",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
